Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.95,0:00:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.63,0:00:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.07,0:01:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The first match of these\Nplayoffs has come to a close.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.31,0:01:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi Moto has emerged\Nvictorious over my valentine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.67,0:01:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He will advance to the next round. Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.21,0:01:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.69,0:01:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have won if not for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.29,0:01:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's help.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.13,0:01:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.21,0:01:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Superb, Duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.57,0:01:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You certainly know how\Nto put on a good show.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.65,0:01:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What a creep!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.43,0:01:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoy this while you can, Pegasus,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.73,0:01:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,because the only reason I'm\Nhere is to rescue my grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.67,0:01:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And once I beat you to get him back, you\Nwon't have anything to chuckle about.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.77,0:01:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm. Proceed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.61,0:01:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The second match of these\Nplayoffs will begin shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.85,0:01:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Bandit Keith will battle Joey Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.55,0:01:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare your decks. Me? Now?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.11,0:01:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Boy, that was sure quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.87,0:02:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, you're going to do fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.03,0:02:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.13,0:02:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.04,0:02:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.95,0:02:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I'm kind of tense.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.87,0:02:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.78,0:02:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You got a few reasons to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.77,0:02:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,First off, look who\Nyou're going up against.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.79,0:02:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Bandit Keith, the\NIntercontinental Champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.15,0:02:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.06,0:02:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,the guy makes his living out of winning
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.97,0:02:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,prize money from\Ntournaments just like these.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.37,0:02:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.15,0:02:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Oh. Hey, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.53,0:02:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.21,0:02:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.93,0:02:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, if I win this, then we're next.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.65,0:02:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You dueling against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.55,0:02:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.75,0:02:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we can look forward\Nto an honorably fought match.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.01,0:02:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.35,0:02:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice call.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.51,0:02:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you give it your best,\Nand I'll give it mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.15,0:02:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And we'll stay best\Nfriends no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.81,0:02:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, there's her man! Go, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.93,0:03:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the deal? Where's Keith?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.27,0:03:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What time is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.71,0:03:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.97,0:03:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Get over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.61,0:03:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, chill out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.13,0:03:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The pummeling will commence\Nas soon as I'm good and ready,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.97,0:03:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,so don't get your briefs in a bunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.95,0:03:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You got that, Blondie?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.77,0:03:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Stall as long as you want, Keith, but you're\Ngonna have to duel me sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.49,0:03:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what you think, you dork.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.73,0:03:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Tournament verification cards, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.09,0:03:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.41,0:03:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Tweed, show the man your card.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.29,0:03:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.20,0:03:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.97,0:03:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Tournament verification card.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.85,0:03:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.76,0:03:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give me a minute, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.67,0:03:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it's in here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.83,0:03:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey lost his tournament entry card?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.89,0:03:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He couldn't be that\Nabsent-minded. Yeah, he could.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.37,0:03:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.49,0:03:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I won't be needing to get up\Noff of this couch after all, huh, Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.55,0:03:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, don't get too comfortable,\Nbecause once I find that card...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.85,0:03:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.76,0:04:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,If you find it within the set time\Nparameters the regulations allow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.71,0:04:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean there's a time limit?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.61,0:04:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And seeing how I snatched that card\Nfrom your coat pocket last night,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.43,0:04:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a hunch the time is going\Nto run out way before you find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.37,0:04:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Retrace your steps, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.81,0:04:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you put it in your coat?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.05,0:04:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess that it could\Nhave fallen out in the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.09,0:04:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna head back\Nthere and check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.11,0:04:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Five minutes. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.35,0:04:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Your match will begin\Nat 11 o 'clock sharp.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.63,0:04:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Extensions are given to no one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.83,0:04:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If you haven't returned with the card\Nby 11 o 'clock, you'll be disqualified.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.97,0:04:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,No fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.11,0:04:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That's fairly enough time for Joey\Nto even make it back to the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.45,0:04:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,These are the rules, and\Nthey will be enforced.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.69,0:04:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Run as fast as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.65,0:04:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't do you any good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.41,0:05:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Your card's got a new owner these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.93,0:05:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can't find that card in three minutes,\Nthen I'll have to forfeit to Keith.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.97,0:05:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, would you guys mind\Nif I took off my boots?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.35,0:05:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Do as you wish, but if you're not in the\Ndueling arena at the designated time,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.43,0:05:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll be disqualified,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.67,0:05:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.58,0:05:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.49,0:05:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, you suits and your rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.33,0:05:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.57,0:05:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't find that card anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.83,0:05:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd give Joey this glory of the king's\Nopposite hand card to duel with,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.69,0:05:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,except then I wouldn't be able to\Nduel Pegasus and save my grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.45,0:05:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, come on. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.19,0:05:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't we just disqualify\Nthat punk right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.85,0:05:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We all know we ain't coming back anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.79,0:05:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.07,0:05:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.98,0:05:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.23,0:05:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.35,0:05:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Your little friend's been\Nscared to death of me ever
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.51,0:06:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,since we had our little\Nrun in back of that cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.09,0:06:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You know he's not looking for that\Nglory of the king's hand card.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.25,0:06:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He's looking for a place to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.17,0:06:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, kiddies,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.47,0:06:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,he probably lost that\Nentry card on purpose
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.91,0:06:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,just so he'd have an\Nexcuse not to duel me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.41,0:06:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty spineless, I'd say.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.59,0:06:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No way. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.95,0:06:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey has never backed\Ndown from a duel before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.19,0:06:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's not going to start\Nto now. He'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.29,0:06:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.73,0:06:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe what you want, Twerp.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.85,0:06:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's only one minute left. Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.07,0:06:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,He had better hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.45,0:06:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, what if he can't find that card?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.59,0:06:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.51,0:06:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Must have searched the whole castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.29,0:06:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And still no card.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.39,0:06:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it, after lasting\Non this island all this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.99,0:06:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,after beating Duelists\Nwith twice my experience,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.53,0:06:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,after getting past all of Pegasus' traps,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.71,0:06:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to get disqualified\Nfrom this tournament,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.77,0:06:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,because it is for losing one lousy card!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.59,0:07:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.01,0:07:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I came close.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.67,0:07:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I came real close.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.65,0:07:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up off the floor, Joey
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.43,0:07:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And quit all your crying\Nalready, you look like a big baby
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.87,0:07:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.99,0:07:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I got something in my eye
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.53,0:07:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid thing won't come out
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.69,0:07:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, just don't go\Nblowing your nose in it
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.13,0:07:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, every time I think I've got\Nyou figured, you surprise me, Joey. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.21,0:07:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya told me about your\Nlittle sister How you're
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.65,0:07:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,dueling to win the tournament's\Nprize money for her,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.29,0:07:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,so she can have that operation?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.25,0:07:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounded like a bad soap\Nopera, to be honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.59,0:07:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,but then who doesn't\Nlove a bad soap opera?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.09,0:07:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, see you around, hon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.13,0:07:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai's card.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.01,0:07:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Mai! Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.21,0:07:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.75,0:08:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So, does this mean that\Nwe're finally friends, Mai?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.83,0:08:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you have a duel to run off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.49,0:08:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.\NOne thing though. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.65,0:08:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him down
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.07,0:08:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.51,0:08:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Dork, of course we're friends
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.41,0:08:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Joey. He made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.89,0:08:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm... Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.73,0:08:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.03,0:08:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,So, the punks come back to\Ngive us the bad news, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.89,0:08:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me guess, you couldn't\Nfind that card anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.35,0:08:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.15,0:08:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I got it right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.79,0:08:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.87,0:08:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm using this card!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.21,0:08:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.53,0:08:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The duel will proceed as scheduled.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.61,0:08:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm already beat. All right, Keith.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.75,0:09:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Nap time is over. Time to duel. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.83,0:09:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, a part of me\Nwanted you to show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.09,0:09:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,A nice little warm-up match\Nmight do me some good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.97,0:09:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll warm you up and wear you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.35,0:09:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.63,0:09:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The second match of these\Nplayoffs will now commence.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.57,0:09:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey Wheeler, Bandit\NKeith, prepare to duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.53,0:09:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.83,0:09:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to win this match or you're out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.97,0:09:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready? Begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.81,0:09:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.49,0:09:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey Wheeler, Bandit Keith, your peers\Nand gracious hosts, await your bout.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.75,0:09:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So let this duel commence.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.81,0:09:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay Joey, your sister's counting on\Nyou, so tell me how it feels to be an
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.31,0:09:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,amateur going up against the\Nintercontinental duel and champion oh the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.41,0:10:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,intercontinental championship i could\Nwin a better prize than that in a
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.55,0:10:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Box of cereal, punk! I'll teach you to\Nrespect my title. One card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.47,0:10:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,In defense mode. Here we go, guys, do
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.69,0:10:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,you think that title gives keith an
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.27,0:10:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Edge? Nah, Joey's got something a lot\Nbetter than titles. He's got guts and
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.21,0:10:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,heart too just remember what you're\Nfighting for joey and you can't lose
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.47,0:10:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,right now take it to him bud this is\Nthe moment you've been waiting for
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.73,0:10:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,okay then it's time to go to\Nwork serenity this duel's for you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.07,0:10:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,sis my turn And I'm throwing a\Nmonster card in defense mode, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.43,0:10:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.34,0:10:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,this ain't gonna be a very exciting match
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.17,0:10:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,if we're both just\Nplaying defense all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.71,0:10:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So I think I'll switch\Nmy card to attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.75,0:10:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Pendulum Machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.49,0:10:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,A machine monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.49,0:10:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.69,0:11:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's about to go into overdrive\Non that defense card of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.37,0:11:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Slashing blade attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.99,0:11:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch. That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.87,0:11:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it isn't bad, huh? Yugi is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.29,0:11:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that Keith's card\Nis set in attack mode,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.63,0:11:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey can see precisely how strong it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.97,0:11:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now all he has to do is play something\Nstronger and he'll be able to destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.21,0:11:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, I wonder why Bandit\NKeith played a machine monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.75,0:11:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,So you gonna make your move or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.09,0:11:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I sure am.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.03,0:11:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's a big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.11,0:11:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,All thanks to your lousy move.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.09,0:11:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Guilty of the night, mash\Nthat machine into scrap metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.47,0:11:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.49,0:11:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Guilty of the night has a higher\Nattack power than Keith's monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.53,0:11:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Soul Spear, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.79,0:11:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.70,0:11:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,My attack's not working. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.15,0:11:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Great Scott, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.95,0:11:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, that can't be right, can it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.15,0:12:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You bet it's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.61,0:12:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,All of my machine monsters are\Nprotected by magic-resistant armor,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.07,0:12:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,so that makes all your\Nmagic attacks worth squat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.05,0:12:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why he played a machine card.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.09,0:12:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,They're magic-proof, and not just\Nagainst magical-type monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.77,0:12:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,but they can withstand attacks\Nfrom any card that uses magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.81,0:12:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, can't we ever catch a break?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.91,0:12:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,My turn. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.51,0:12:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And I got another well-oiled\Nmachine all ready for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.45,0:12:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Launcher Spider!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.57,0:12:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Spider!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.48,0:12:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,More machines, just great.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.19,0:12:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,His whole deck is probably full of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.47,0:12:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Spider, shock rocket attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.13,0:12:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, punk, fight me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.53,0:12:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's more fun when you struggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.23,0:12:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I knew I'd get a\Nrough match from Keith,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.09,0:12:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,but I wasn't prepared for\Nthese big metal bullies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.87,0:12:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,they're tough true still\Nno machine is without its
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.47,0:13:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,glitch so what's their glitch\Nyugi i'm not sure machine
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.91,0:13:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,monsters are some of the\Nmost powerful monsters in
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.09,0:13:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,the dueling world not only\Nare they impervious to
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.99,0:13:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,magic attacks but they have\Nan amazingly strong offense
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.09,0:13:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,as well but they can only\Nuse that strong offense
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.69,0:13:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,one way against head-on\Nattacks maybe if joey plays
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.83,0:13:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,his cards right He can\Nuse that to his advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.57,0:13:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Attacking those metal freaks\Nwill just get me clobbered.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.31,0:13:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I'll play this face down and\Nput his monster in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.55,0:13:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.77,0:13:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Afraid to fight like a man?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.35,0:13:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.35,0:13:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,If this guy keeps throwing\Ncards in defensive mode,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.49,0:13:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never get at his life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.45,0:13:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta draw him out,\Nget him to attack me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.33,0:13:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he'll be open for some real damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.29,0:13:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll lay a card face-down,\Ntoo, and this in defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.07,0:13:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,My mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.53,0:13:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Just forget what you saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.35,0:14:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyhow, as I was saying, I'll\Nplay this card in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.15,0:14:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever that was, it sure looked ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.83,0:14:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But not metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.73,0:14:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.03,0:14:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That card wasn't a machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.81,0:14:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a shadow monster called Zoa, A\Nbeast my Flame Swordsman could post easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.57,0:14:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And unlike Machine Monsters,\Nit's totally vulnerable to magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.67,0:14:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, check out Joey's\Nbig grin. Something's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.05,0:14:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know. Huh? Know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.71,0:14:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Flame Swordsman!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.71,0:14:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,In attack mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.95,0:14:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The attack points of that\NZoa card Keith dropped.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.29,0:14:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,They're higher than its defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.57,0:14:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.87,0:14:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.33,0:14:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll add this magic card, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.39,0:14:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Since Zoa's attack is\Nmore than his defense,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.21,0:14:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,it makes little sense to\Nplay him in defensive mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.19,0:14:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless Keith is trying to\Nlure Joey into attacking him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.79,0:14:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Salamandra!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.29,0:14:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,His magic raises my attack\Npower by 700 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.67,0:14:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So then Keith must have\Nshown Zoa on purpose!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.71,0:15:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.79,0:15:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Swordsman, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.85,0:15:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.09,0:15:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,My trap activates! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.45,0:15:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, magic metal force!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.37,0:15:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Zoha is Metal Zoha, with 400\Nattack and defense points stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.05,0:15:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, no big thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.47,0:15:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's not all, Blondie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.63,0:15:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That new metallic paint\Njob he's sporting deflects
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.69,0:15:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,all magic attacks back\Nto where they came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.43,0:15:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,My swordsman!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.99,0:15:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.07,0:15:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Just watch this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.81,0:15:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.83,0:15:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,My swordsman's been outmaneuving.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.77,0:15:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have seen the look\Non your loser face, you dweeb.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.01,0:15:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,When your swordsman's own attack\Ntoasted him, it was priceless.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.41,0:15:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm just getting started.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.95,0:15:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.15,0:15:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.21,0:16:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Next on my list is that\Nlittle defense card of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.27,0:16:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But he won't be defending much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.79,0:16:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,A stock defense card?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.43,0:16:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see what you're hiding there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.63,0:16:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,An Axe Raider, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.55,0:16:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.87,0:16:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Not for my Metal Zoa, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.29,0:16:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.39,0:16:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's life points will be all gone\Nif that Metal Zoa's attack hits!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.25,0:16:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't tough, bud!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.73,0:16:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayonara, sucker!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.21,0:16:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Metal Zoa, attack the Axe Raider!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.99,0:16:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.05,0:16:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.55,0:16:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice move, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.87,0:16:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.78,0:16:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You fell right in my\Ntrap, just like I planned!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.19,0:16:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.10,0:16:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You set a trap for me? Perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.37,0:16:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The Chasm of Spikes card!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.17,0:16:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Now not only is Metal Zoa destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.45,0:16:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,but one quarter of his attack points will\Nbe deducted from Keith's life points!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.85,0:16:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.37,0:17:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I only wish you could\Nhave seen the look on your
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.57,0:17:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,face when that Metal Zoa\Nof yours got shish kebab.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.73,0:17:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It was priceless.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.91,0:17:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You tell him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.73,0:17:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about time someone gave that bandit\NKeith Jerk a taste of his own medicine!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.17,0:17:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not the only way he's\Nturning the tables on Keith.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.27,0:17:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I think Joey might have finally found\Nthe glitch in those machine monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.33,0:17:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Rather than try and beat\Nthem in a direct assault,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.85,0:17:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,he's letting his traps do all the work.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.41,0:17:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And now Keith's only winning\Nby 100 life points. All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.59,0:17:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Joe, go! My turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.29,0:17:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,At first, I'm laying his face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.07,0:17:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and it's a trap card,\Nso don't bother attacking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.95,0:17:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, will you just look at him duel?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.59,0:17:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful, you haven't\Nwon this duel yet, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.43,0:17:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You amateur!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.57,0:17:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That's gotta be the lousiest bluff I've\Never heard in my entire dueling career.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.09,0:17:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And next, I'm switching my Axe\NRaider back to defensive mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.03,0:17:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And throwing this in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.05,0:17:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Garoozies!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.43,0:17:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Now chug that pendulum machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.63,0:18:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.54,0:18:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,With Battle Blade Strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.57,0:18:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.48,0:18:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.47,0:18:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a permanent vacation at\Nthe scrapyard, you hunk of junk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.07,0:18:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.65,0:18:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Launch a spider!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.03,0:18:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Demolish Garoozies!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.97,0:18:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you didn't have another trap card.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.07,0:18:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong again, Keith.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.45,0:18:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You thought I was bluffing and\Nnow you're gonna pay for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.17,0:18:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.05,0:18:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Kunai with chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.55,0:18:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And once activated, it raises\Nmy attack power 500 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.97,0:18:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack, Garuzis!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.97,0:18:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Battleaxe crush!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.27,0:18:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, it's still close, but Joey\Nhas just won himself a slight lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.89,0:18:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew he'd make a comeback!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.79,0:18:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's trusting his instincts\Nand believing in his cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.39,0:18:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He's dueling like a true champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.17,0:18:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.05,0:19:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If you keep this up, you'll\Nbe dueling Pegasus in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.71,0:19:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to let him\Nmake a fool out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.35,0:19:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Mr. Champ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.29,0:19:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're losing\Nyour cool to an amateur like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.87,0:19:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.78,0:19:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the big joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.51,0:19:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The joke is on you, Blondie.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.43,0:19:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You're already counting the\Ntournament's prize money
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.81,0:19:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,and this duel ain't even\Nclose to being over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.45,0:19:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.25,0:19:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You think your traps\Nwill last you forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.59,0:19:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna run out sooner or later,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.99,0:19:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And then I'll bring out my bigger machines\Nand really give our audience a show.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.81,0:19:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going down you're\Nsniffling little wannabe
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.11,0:19:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody beats bandit key
